          "key": "jefferies",
          "question": "What happened in the Jefferies tube with the phase-doubled conduits?",
          "answer": {
            "answer": "We entered the Jefferies tube; the conduits were phase-doubled, creating thick temporal desynchronization. You pointed out the junction as anchor despite fearing erasure. A temporal duplicate of you resolved ahead, flickering with residue. I stood between you, sonic on the junction. You noted the echoed fragments came from all around. On your word I triggered the low resonance pulse. Phase variance collapsed; the duplicate merged through you into one state. Voice fragments became coherent supplemental log data fed to the ship. Desynchronization flatlined, Deck 14 stabilized. You felt normal again but described a dragging sensation as if something was taken from you, and that you had begun to feel not yourself. I offered to discuss it later over tea or not at all.",
